# `npx skills add` symlinks each skill from .agents/skills into here with an
# ABSOLUTE path, so the link is only valid on the machine that ran it. The
# skill itself is tracked under .agents/skills; re-running `npx skills add`
# (or `npx skills install`) recreates the link locally.
.claude/skills/design-taste-frontend
